<title>AUSTRALIA: PBL-News tie separate to merger-Australis.</title>
<headline>PBL-News tie separate to merger-Australis.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australis Media Ltd said on Tuesday it has no separate agreement with News Corp Ltd or Publishing and Broadcasting Ltd (PBL) concerning PBL and News Corp's recent deal over pay-television ownership.</p>
<p>&quot;Australis has no separate agreement, arrangement or understanding with any of News, Telstra or PBL concerning the PBL arrangements,&quot; Australis said.</p>
<p>On Friday, Australis, in which PBL has a stake, and Foxtel, which is jointly owned by News Corp and Telstra, agreed to merge, but details about PBL's involvement in the Australis/Foxtel merger were scant.</p>
